    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alert escalation calls\nYour monitoring tool sends `{\"message\": \"...\"}` to **Alert received**. If the on-call engineer doesn't answer, the backup is called.\n\n### Set up\n1. Open each Vobiz node and pick your **Vobiz** credential.\n2. Open **Answer the call**, then **Webhook URLs** → **Production URL**, and copy it into **Answer URL** on the node that makes the call. Do this for both call nodes.\n3. Choose the **From Number** in both call nodes.\n4. Put the on-call number in **Call the on-call engineer** → **To**, and its last 10 digits in **On-call did not answer?** in place of XXXXXXXXXX.\n5. Put the backup number in **Call the backup engineer** → **To**.\n6. **Publish** the workflow.\n\n**Calls are real and billed to your Vobiz account.** Test with your own number first.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "212a24b8-a341-4b9d-a3dd-02e7192be9c0",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -240
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Alert received": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Call the on-call engineer",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Answer the call": {
      "main": [
